@startuml

' Sequence Diagram for Order List Retrieval and Status Update

title MES API Order List Retrieval and Status Update (with Caching)

actor Operator
participant MES_UI
participant MESAPI
participant Redis
participant MESDB

== Order List Retrieval ==
Operator -> MES_UI: Request order list
MES_UI -> MESAPI: Fetch order list
MESAPI -> Redis: Check cache for order list
alt Cache Hit
  Redis -> MESAPI: Return cached order list
else Cache Miss
  MESAPI -> MESDB: Query order list from DB
  MESDB -> MESAPI: Return order list
  MESAPI -> Redis: Store order list in cache (Cache-Aside)
end
MESAPI -> MES_UI: Return order list
MES_UI -> Operator: Display order list

== Order Status Update ==
Operator -> MES_UI: Update order status
MES_UI -> MESAPI: Send status update
MESAPI -> Redis: Update cache (Write-Through)
MESAPI -> MESDB: Persist new status in DB
MESDB -> MESAPI: Confirm update
MESAPI -> MES_UI: Confirm update
MES_UI -> Operator: Display updated status

@enduml